==================================================

Use the same concept as the reference, but adapted to ChatPop branding.

Style requirements:

- dark blurred background overlay behind the menu
- menu items floating on top with a clean premium look
- soft iOS-style animation
- black / dark interface background
- use ChatPop brand colors instead of random colors
- keep the icons visually distinct and attractive

