==================================================
9. TESTING
==================================================

Test the following:

1. Tap "+" -> menu rises upward smoothly
2. Tap "X" -> menu collapses downward smoothly
3. Tap outside -> menu closes properly
4. Reopen multiple times -> no glitch or stuck state
